1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Datawhale-EAI builds a reproducible AMD Physical AI stack across dexterous hands, household manipulation, simulation, and rendering.
Datawhale-EAI 构建一套可复现的 AMD Physical AI 系统，覆盖灵巧手、家庭操作、仿真与渲染。

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:28,000
One AMD stack. Many physical worlds. The same evidence contract follows data, policy, physics, and proof.
一套 AMD 栈，连接多个物理世界。数据、策略、物理与证据遵循同一套契约。

3
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:48,000
RoboCasa365 gives the project a household manipulation benchmark with fixed tasks, seeds, videos, and a mobile observation contract.
RoboCasa365 提供家庭操作基准，任务、种子、视频和移动观测接口都固定记录。

4
00:00:48,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Long-horizon success traces make the action sequence inspectable, not just the final frame.
长时序成功轨迹让每个动作步骤都可检查，而不只是展示最后一帧。

5
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:32,000
DexJoCo brings contact-rich dexterous tasks into the same protocol with native JAX on AMD ROCm.
DexJoCo 将接触丰富的灵巧操作纳入同一协议，并在 AMD ROCm 上使用原生 JAX。

6
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Official seed results, recovery searches, and diagnostic runs remain separate numbers with separate denominators.
官方种子、恢复搜索和单任务诊断分别统计，各自保留清晰分母。

7
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:14,000
The evidence contract is simple: data to policy, policy to physics, physics to proof.
证据契约很简单：数据进入策略，策略作用于物理，物理执行产生证明。

8
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:38,000
DISCOVERSE preserves expert paths, policy experiments, multi-view rendering, and MP4 output after migration.
DISCOVERSE 迁移后保留专家轨迹、策略实验、多视角渲染和 MP4 输出。

9
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:54,000
3D Gaussian Splatting and dynamic replay turn the renderer itself into visible migration evidence.
3D Gaussian Splatting 与动态回放让渲染迁移本身变成可见证据。

10
00:02:54,000 --> 00:03:14,000
ROCm versions, GPU identity, memory, throughput, training time, JSON, MP4, and SHA travel with every result.
ROCm 版本、GPU 身份、显存、吞吐、训练时间、JSON、MP4 与 SHA 随结果一起保存。

11
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:38,000
Success leads the story, but the source evidence stays attached behind it.
成功案例先讲，但源视频和原始证据始终随结果保留。

12
00:03:38,000 --> 00:04:06,000
Failures are part of the benchmark: action alignment, navigation, contact, and recovery are diagnosed instead of hidden.
失败也是基准的一部分：动作对齐、导航、接触和恢复问题被诊断，而不是隐藏。

13
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:20,000
Build it, run it, and show the proof through code, notebooks, weights, reports, videos, and reproducible commands.
用代码、Notebook、权重、报告、视频和可复现命令，把它跑起来并展示证据。
